{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Adf52MZLtfqD2gGcvXgEYc","type":"tool_result","content":"1577\t### 8.4 Phase 7's entry conditions\n1578\t\n1579\t**DECIDED** (frozen §10 phase 7). 6a-6c green on three hosts; the row\n1580\tcarrier the only writer and reader the semantic-register kernel has; a\n1581\tdocumented seam for the holder, checkpoint, ledger and authority paths\n1582\t(phase 7 wires it; phase 6 edits none of them); the Stage D/E scenarios\n1583\t(`stage_e_scenarios.cljc`, `checkpoint_fixtures.cljc`) listed with, for\n1584\teach, the §5.2 row that exercises its parking shape; the export-recovery\n1585\tobject (UCF §7.7.4, format version 1 over the old codec) re-based on the\n1586\trow carrier by phase 7, since it embeds a body; and the free-environment\n1587\tretention seam (§6.3) either landed by the 4b track or the explicit\n1588\t`:free-env` argument threaded through the holder's export path.\n1589\t\n1590\t### 8.5 Ordering and concurrency\n1591\t\n1592\t| | needs | concurrent with |\n1593\t|---|---|---|\n1594\t| 6a | 4b stage 1 (branch) | 4b stage 2, 5a-5c, 6c-pre |\n1595\t| 6c-pre | nothing of 4b or 5 | everything |\n1596\t| 6b | 4b stage 2; 5c (scanners) | 5a, 5b, 6c-pre |\n1597\t| 6c | 5a, 5b, 6b, 6c-pre | 5c |\n1598\t\n1599\tNo file of 4b or phase 5 is edited. The old kernel file\n1600\t`debruijn/stack.cljc` is edited by 6c-pre only, for the seam; the\n1601\tregister kernel is not edited. `handoff.cljc` and the old harness are\n1602\tnot edited.\n1603\t\n1604\t---\n1605\t\n1606\t## 9. Verification honesty"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"23e67cb0-f183-4c2e-b3d6-2e5b6c44b814","uuid":"7b51d1b5-999a-4813-87ef-406293132d9f","timestamp":"2026-10-13T08:31:33.906Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-srvm-p7plan/docs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.continuation.md","content":"### 8.4 Phase 7's entry conditions\n\n**DECIDED** (frozen §10 phase 7). 6a-6c green on three hosts; the row\ncarrier the only writer and reader the semantic-register kernel has; a\ndocumented seam for the holder, checkpoint, ledger and authority paths\n(phase 7 wires it; phase 6 edits none of them); the Stage D/E scenarios\n(`stage_e_scenarios.cljc`, `checkpoint_fixtures.cljc`) listed with, for\neach, the §5.2 row that exercises its parking shape; the export-recovery\nobject (UCF §7.7.4, format version 1 over the old codec) re-based on the\nrow carrier by phase 7, since it embeds a body; and the free-environment\nretention seam (§6.3) either landed by the 4b track or the explicit\n`:free-env` argument threaded through the holder's export path.\n\n### 8.5 Ordering and concurrency\n\n| | needs | concurrent with |\n|---|---|---|\n| 6a | 4b stage 1 (branch) | 4b stage 2, 5a-5c, 6c-pre |\n| 6c-pre | nothing of 4b or 5 | everything |\n| 6b | 4b stage 2; 5c (scanners) | 5a, 5b, 6c-pre |\n| 6c | 5a, 5b, 6b, 6c-pre | 5c |\n\nNo file of 4b or phase 5 is edited. The old kernel file\n`debruijn/stack.cljc` is edited by 6c-pre only, for the seam; the\nregister kernel is not edited. `handoff.cljc` and the old harness are\nnot edited.\n\n---\n\n## 9. Verification honesty","numLines":30,"startLine":1577,"totalLines":2118}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Adf52MZLtfqD2gGcvXgEYc","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
