{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EwprCHB3T7R8rjtvmbyq6S","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t(ns yin.vm.ucf.stage-e-rows-test\n2\t  \"M-next stage E, the isolated-runtime form on every lane: every\n3\t   scenario of yin.vm.ucf.stage-e-scenarios run in this process, each\n4\t   life a fresh runtime over the scenario's durable root, each kill the\n5\t   life's mortal media going dead at its named cut.  On Dart this is the\n6\t   whole of stage E's evidence (its process transport is recorded\n7\t   separately); on the JVM and Node it is the same-runtime control\n8\t   beside the separate-process matrix of\n9\t   yin.vm.ucf.stage-e-process-test.\n10\t\n11\t   Full 13-row acceptance matrix mapping (linker-dht 14.2.4 & UCF 7.11):\n12\t   - Row 1: candidates and encodings (row-1-candidates-and-encodings-test)\n13\t   - Row 2: export phases & carrier failures (row-2-export-phases-test, row-2-carrier-failures-test)\n14\t   - Row 3: reclaim (row-3-reclaim-test)\n15\t   - Row 4: kills around result delivery (row-4-kills-around-result-delivery-test)\n16\t   - Row 5: replay divergence (row-5-replay-divergence-test)\n17\t   - Row 6: partition (row-6-partition-test)\n18\t   - Row 7: kills around completion & failure-lower (row-7-kills-around-completion-test, row-7-failure-lower-and-lost-authority-test)\n19\t   - Clause 8: admission order & cross-target conflict (clause-8-admission-order-test)\n20\t   - Clause 3: sequence and regrant (clause-3-sequence-and-regrant-test)\n21\t   - Fork: fork per host (fork-per-host-test)\n22\t   - Inbox & Journal: positional inboxes & crash recovery (inbox-and-journal-cuts-test)\n23\t   - Row 10 canonical-byte agreement: exercised cross-host in stage-e-process-test\n24\t     (ordered JVM/Node pairs over file media).\"\n25\t  (:require [clojure.test :refer [deftest]]\n26\t            [dao.test-slow :as slow]\n27\t            [yin.vm.ucf.stage-e-scenarios :as sc]))\n28\t\n29\t\n30\t(defn- run-all\n31\t  [scenarios]\n32\t  (doseq [s scenarios]\n33\t    (sc/run-in-process s)))\n34\t\n35\t\n36\t(deftest fork-per-host-test\n37\t  (run-all [sc/fork-row]))\n38\t\n39\t\n40\t(deftest ^:slow row-7-kills-around-completion-test\n41\t  (slow/guard\n42\t    \"row-7-kills-around-completion-test\"\n43\t    (fn []\n44\t      (run-all (map sc/row7 sc/row7-cuts)))))\n45\t\n46\t\n47\t(deftest row-7-failure-lower-and-lost-authority-test\n48\t  (run-all [sc/row7-failure-lower sc/row7-lost-authority]))\n49\t\n50\t\n51\t(deftest ^:slow row-4-kills-around-result-delivery-test\n52\t  (slow/guard\n53\t    \"row-4-kills-around-result-delivery-test\"\n54\t    (fn []\n55\t      (run-all (map sc/row4 sc/row4-cuts)))))\n56\t\n57\t\n58\t(deftest row-3-reclaim-test\n59\t  (run-all (map sc/row3 sc/row3-variants)))\n60\t\n61\t\n62\t(deftest row-5-replay-divergence-test\n63\t  (run-all (map sc/row5 sc/row5-variants)))\n64\t\n65\t\n66\t(deftest ^:slow row-2-export-phases-test\n67\t  (slow/guard\n68\t    \"row-2-export-phases-test\"\n69\t    (fn []\n70\t      (run-all (map sc/row2 (concat sc/row2-pre-fence-cuts sc/row2-post-fence-cuts))))))\n71\t\n72\t\n73\t(deftest ^:slow row-2-carrier-failures-test\n74\t  (slow/guard\n75\t    \"row-2-carrier-failures-test\"\n76\t    (fn []\n77\t      (run-all (map sc/row2-carrier sc/row2-carriers)))))\n78\t\n79\t\n80\t(deftest row-1-candidates-and-encodings-test\n81\t  (run-all [sc/row1]))\n82\t\n83\t\n84\t(deftest ^:slow row-6-partition-test\n85\t  (slow/guard\n86\t    \"row-6-partition-test\"\n87\t    (fn []\n88\t      (run-all [sc/row6-request-partition sc/row6-consumer-partition sc/row6-lost-reply]))))\n89\t\n90\t\n91\t(deftest ^:slow clause-8-admission-order-test\n92\t  (slow/guard\n93\t    \"clause-8-admission-order-test\"\n94\t    (fn []\n95\t      (run-all (concat (map sc/clause8 sc/clause8-variants) [sc/clause8-closed])))))\n96\t\n97\t\n98\t(deftest ^:slow clause-3-sequence-and-regrant-test\n99\t  (slow/guard\n100\t    \"clause-3-sequence-and-regrant-test\"\n101\t    (fn []\n102\t      (run-all [sc/clause3-regrant sc/clause3-carried]))))\n103\t\n104\t\n105\t(deftest ^:slow inbox-and-journal-cuts-test\n106\t  (slow/guard\n107\t    \"inbox-and-journal-cuts-test\"\n108\t    (fn []\n109\t      (run-all (concat (map #(sc/journal-row {:cut %}) sc/journal-cuts)\n110\t                       (map #(sc/journal-row {:fail %}) sc/uncertain-retentions))))))\n111\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"23e67cb0-f183-4c2e-b3d6-2e5b6c44b814","uuid":"9095e621-fa0d-42d4-b440-7256ee7970a1","timestamp":"2026-10-13T08:32:03.372Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-srvm-p7plan/test/yin/vm/ucf/stage_e_rows_test.cljc","content":"(ns yin.vm.ucf.stage-e-rows-test\n  \"M-next stage E, the isolated-runtime form on every lane: every\n   scenario of yin.vm.ucf.stage-e-scenarios run in this process, each\n   life a fresh runtime over the scenario's durable root, each kill the\n   life's mortal media going dead at its named cut.  On Dart this is the\n   whole of stage E's evidence (its process transport is recorded\n   separately); on the JVM and Node it is the same-runtime control\n   beside the separate-process matrix of\n   yin.vm.ucf.stage-e-process-test.\n\n   Full 13-row acceptance matrix mapping (linker-dht 14.2.4 & UCF 7.11):\n   - Row 1: candidates and encodings (row-1-candidates-and-encodings-test)\n   - Row 2: export phases & carrier failures (row-2-export-phases-test, row-2-carrier-failures-test)\n   - Row 3: reclaim (row-3-reclaim-test)\n   - Row 4: kills around result delivery (row-4-kills-around-result-delivery-test)\n   - Row 5: replay divergence (row-5-replay-divergence-test)\n   - Row 6: partition (row-6-partition-test)\n   - Row 7: kills around completion & failure-lower (row-7-kills-around-completion-test, row-7-failure-lower-and-lost-authority-test)\n   - Clause 8: admission order & cross-target conflict (clause-8-admission-order-test)\n   - Clause 3: sequence and regrant (clause-3-sequence-and-regrant-test)\n   - Fork: fork per host (fork-per-host-test)\n   - Inbox & Journal: positional inboxes & crash recovery (inbox-and-journal-cuts-test)\n   - Row 10 canonical-byte agreement: exercised cross-host in stage-e-process-test\n     (ordered JVM/Node pairs over file media).\"\n  (:require [clojure.test :refer [deftest]]\n            [dao.test-slow :as slow]\n            [yin.vm.ucf.stage-e-scenarios :as sc]))\n\n\n(defn- run-all\n  [scenarios]\n  (doseq [s scenarios]\n    (sc/run-in-process s)))\n\n\n(deftest fork-per-host-test\n  (run-all [sc/fork-row]))\n\n\n(deftest ^:slow row-7-kills-around-completion-test\n  (slow/guard\n    \"row-7-kills-around-completion-test\"\n    (fn []\n      (run-all (map sc/row7 sc/row7-cuts)))))\n\n\n(deftest row-7-failure-lower-and-lost-authority-test\n  (run-all [sc/row7-failure-lower sc/row7-lost-authority]))\n\n\n(deftest ^:slow row-4-kills-around-result-delivery-test\n  (slow/guard\n    \"row-4-kills-around-result-delivery-test\"\n    (fn []\n      (run-all (map sc/row4 sc/row4-cuts)))))\n\n\n(deftest row-3-reclaim-test\n  (run-all (map sc/row3 sc/row3-variants)))\n\n\n(deftest row-5-replay-divergence-test\n  (run-all (map sc/row5 sc/row5-variants)))\n\n\n(deftest ^:slow row-2-export-phases-test\n  (slow/guard\n    \"row-2-export-phases-test\"\n    (fn []\n      (run-all (map sc/row2 (concat sc/row2-pre-fence-cuts sc/row2-post-fence-cuts))))))\n\n\n(deftest ^:slow row-2-carrier-failures-test\n  (slow/guard\n    \"row-2-carrier-failures-test\"\n    (fn []\n      (run-all (map sc/row2-carrier sc/row2-carriers)))))\n\n\n(deftest row-1-candidates-and-encodings-test\n  (run-all [sc/row1]))\n\n\n(deftest ^:slow row-6-partition-test\n  (slow/guard\n    \"row-6-partition-test\"\n    (fn []\n      (run-all [sc/row6-request-partition sc/row6-consumer-partition sc/row6-lost-reply]))))\n\n\n(deftest ^:slow clause-8-admission-order-test\n  (slow/guard\n    \"clause-8-admission-order-test\"\n    (fn []\n      (run-all (concat (map sc/clause8 sc/clause8-variants) [sc/clause8-closed])))))\n\n\n(deftest ^:slow clause-3-sequence-and-regrant-test\n  (slow/guard\n    \"clause-3-sequence-and-regrant-test\"\n    (fn []\n      (run-all [sc/clause3-regrant sc/clause3-carried]))))\n\n\n(deftest ^:slow inbox-and-journal-cuts-test\n  (slow/guard\n    \"inbox-and-journal-cuts-test\"\n    (fn []\n      (run-all (concat (map #(sc/journal-row {:cut %}) sc/journal-cuts)\n                       (map #(sc/journal-row {:fail %}) sc/uncertain-retentions))))))\n","numLines":111,"startLine":1,"totalLines":111}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01EwprCHB3T7R8rjtvmbyq6S","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
