{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AgfzNGGTphHYMMePWCGMvT","type":"tool_result","content":"1540\t(defn- lower\n1541\t  \"D10's lower with the accepted grant's inputs, over the receiver:\n1542\t  the checkpoint address, the composition's protection declaration, and\n1543\t  the grant -- lease, holder, the evidence `E` and the current tenure\n1544\t  as numbers, `now` the clock's reading and `bound` the grant's\n1545\t  duration over the observation basis.\"\n1546\t  [state l holder E reading]\n1547\t  (let [units (:units state)\n1548\t        grant (:grant holder)\n1549\t        basis (:granted-at holder)\n1550\t        duration (:dao.lease/duration grant)\n1551\t        base (fn [d]\n1552\t               (let [entry (first d)]\n1553\t                 (* (val entry) (get units (key entry)))))]\n1554\t    (handoff/resume-task\n1555\t      (assoc (:receiver state) :attach-stream (get-in state [:seams :attach!]))\n1556\t      (:bytes state)\n1557\t      (get-in state [:seams :attach!])\n1558\t      {:exclusive true\n1559\t       :address (:address state)\n1560\t       :protection (:protection state)\n1561\t       :grant {:checkpoint (:address state)\n1562\t               :dao.lease/lease l\n1563\t               :dao.lease/holder (:me state)\n1564\t               :tenure {:now (base reading)\n1565\t                        :bound (let [duration-bound (+ (max (base basis)\n1566\t                                                            (base (or (:last-renewal-at holder) basis)))\n1567\t                                                       (base duration))]\n1568\t                                 (if-some [cap (:dao.lease/max grant)]\n1569\t                                   (min duration-bound (+ (base basis) (base cap)))\n1570\t                                   duration-bound))\n1571\t                        :live true}\n1572\t               :evidence E}})))\n1573\t\n1574\t\n1575\t(defn- accept\n1576\t  \"The grant `fact`, read